# Normalise line endings. The owner develops on Windows, CI and Render run on
# Linux. Without this, Git on Windows may check files out with CRLF, Prettier
# then reports every file as changed, and shell scripts fail on Linux with
# "/bin/bash^M: bad interpreter".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
